## Interface: 11509, 20506
## Title: Ascent
## Notes: Per-level leveling analytics. Where every point of experience came from, and how you played to earn it.
## Notes-esES: Analítica de leveleo por nivel. De dónde salió cada punto de experiencia y cómo jugaste para conseguirlo.
## Author: crewtives
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: AscentDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: AscentCharDB
## X-Category: Leveling
## X-License: MIT
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1706237
## DefaultState: enabled

# Load order is explicit and layered. A file may only reference what loads above it.
#
#   1. core/       pure domain. Must never touch the WoW API (enforced by .luacheckrc).
#   2. adapter/    translates between the client and the domain.
#   3. ui/         consumes view-models built by core.
#   4. locale/     localization tables.
#   5. app/        composition root. The only file that sees all three layers.

